firewallnat
netmap source srcint port1_3 dstint port1_1 type ipv4 srcip 10.30.0.64/28 dstip 0.0.0.0/0 transip 192.0.2.64/28
netmap destination srcint port1_1 dstint port1_3 type ipv4 srcip 0.0.0.0/0 dstip 192.0.2.64/28 transip 10.30.0.64/28
